WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.820
Three days after surgery, you may shower

2
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:04.940
and wash your hair.

3
00:00:05.132 --> 00:00:07.660
Your clinic will give you the date for your wound

4
00:00:07.727 --> 00:00:09.100
check and ear exam.

5
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.820
The stitches dissolve, so they do not

6
00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:13.020
need to be removed.

7
00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.020
Take your antibiotic the way it was prescribed.

8
00:00:16.207 --> 00:00:18.100
It helps prevent infection.

9
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.100
Take your pain medicine the way it was prescribed.

10
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.580
Take it before the pain gets bad.
